{"task_id": "Mbpp/104", "solution": "def sort_sublists(input_collection: object) -> list:\n    \"\"\"\n    Sorts each sublist of strings in the input collection lexicographically.\n    Returns a new list of lists, preserving the input structure and not modifying the original data.\n    \"\"\"\n    sorted_collection = []\n    for sublist in input_collection:\n        # Creates a new sorted list for each sublist without modifying the input.\n        sorted_sublist = sorted(sublist)\n        sorted_collection.append(sorted_sublist)\n    return sorted_collection"}
