{"task_id": "Mbpp/412", "solution": "```python\nfrom typing import List\n\ndef remove_odd(nums: List[int]) -> List[int]:\n    \"\"\"Filters a list of integers, returning only the even numbers.\n    The relative order of even numbers is preserved from the input list.\"\"\"\n    result: List[int] = []\n    for x in nums:\n        if x % 2 == 0:\n            result.append(x)\n    return result\n```"}
