{"task_id": "Mbpp/476", "solution": "```python\n# src/__init__.py\nfrom .big_sum import big_sum\n```\n```python\n# src/big_sum.py\ndef validate(array):\n    \"\"\"\n    Validates the input array for non-emptiness and numeric content.\n    Raises ValueError or TypeError on validation failure.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not array:\n        raise ValueError(\"array must not be empty\")\n\n    for item in array:\n        if not isinstance(item, (int, float)):\n            raise TypeError(\"array must contain only numeric values\")\n    return True\n\ndef big_sum(array):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the smallest and largest numeric values in an array.\n    Ensures input is valid and raises exceptions for invalid data.\n    \"\"\"\n    validate(array)\n    \n    min_val = min(array)\n    max_val = max(array)\n    \n    return min_val + max_val\n```"}
