{"task_id": "Mbpp/730", "solution": "```python\ndef consecutive_duplicates(input_list):\n    \"\"\"\n    Removes consecutive duplicates from a list, collapsing maximal runs of equal elements.\n    Preserves non-consecutive duplicates and returns an empty list for empty input.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not input_list:\n        return []\n\n    output_list = []\n    output_list.append(input_list[0])\n\n    for i in range(1, len(input_list)):\n        current_element = input_list[i]\n        last_appended_element = output_list[-1]\n\n        if current_element != last_appended_element:\n            output_list.append(current_element)\n\n    return output_list\n```"}
